# The generator is run with `go run`, but a stray `go build` drops a binary named
# after the package directory at the repo root. It is 7 MB of build output and
# has no business in a profile repo.
/cards
cmd/cards/cards

# Live GraphQL responses captured with -dump. Useful locally, but they carry the
# full profile payload and the committed fixture is the one that should be read.
/profile.json
